    "$t": "回復台語"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>施玉鳳</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">總統你好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語tio̍h-ài　CPR</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語講了好</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣國防　免煩惱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khah好一台戰鬥機</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語若無--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">民主拍拚為啥mi̍h？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">土地芬芳kám koh tī？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語若無--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán ē hōo人掠去khōng-ku-lí</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣母親ē哭--死</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語傳--落-去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">佛祖ē保庇　上帝看著lín</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囝孫代代　好八字</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">囡仔抱--leh</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lín祖媽kah伊拚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（獻hōo第一屆全國台語政策民間會議ê有志）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhp0zQRstmGQlBZY6htmkJSrU6qH-QSbv5Gm0hsP1TLPN8ae5n7u0YhRNBIm_ejNmyRIMx2E4rECU4D6hyphenhyphenUraShYZ8Q-16mcic1WWRo1ubRYcbq5hNS4kf_pRLTsMQsr1HTs8kVv75k3fniUqKNU0vyXMiv3xsS1dHunYegbOTr4WUwfmzvjcyc71JBmqBT/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_01_A.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhp0zQRstmGQlBZY6htmkJSrU6qH-QSbv5Gm0hsP1TLPN8ae5n7u0YhRNBIm_ejNmyRIMx2E4rECU4D6hyphenhyphenUraShYZ8Q-16mcic1WWRo1ubRYcbq5hNS4kf_pRLTsMQsr1HTs8kVv75k3fniUqKNU0vyXMiv3xsS1dHunYegbOTr4WUwfmzvjcyc71JBmqBT/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_01_A.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMh